############################################################
# PHASE 6 - End-to-end validation on 10 real inventory cars #
############################################################

Inventory loaded: 98 cars. Selected 10 (spanning the real distribution):

  # 61 Kia Sportage | Diesel | SUV | 2019 | 141,000km | 100kW (variant_HK->kW) | EUR 11,800
  # 41 Dacia Duster | Petrol | SUV | 2024 | 24,000km | 109kW (variant_HP->kW) | EUR 17,600
  #  0 Hyundai I30 | Petrol | Estate | 2023 | 122,000km | 88kW (variant_HP->kW) | EUR 11,600
  #  3 Honda Jazz | Petrol | Hatchback | 2017 | 84,748km | 74kW (variant_HP->kW) | EUR 6,000
  #  4 Toyota Rav4 | Hybrid | SUV | 2019 | 93,545km | ?kW (missing) | EUR 17,000
  #  6 Toyota Auris | Hybrid | Hatchback | 2015 | 150,000km | 72kW (variant_HP->kW) | EUR 7,200
  # 21 Renault Mégane | PHEV | Estate | 2020 | 99,000km | 118kW (variant_HK->kW) | EUR 11,500
  # 77 VW ID.3 | Electric | Hatchback | 2021 | 213,000km | 150kW (variant_HK->kW) | EUR 9,000
  # 14 BMW X1 | Petrol | SUV | 2018 | 119,000km | 102kW (variant_HP->kW) | EUR 11,500
  # 57 VW Passat | Diesel | Estate | 2006 | 386,000km | 103kW (variant_HK->kW) | EUR 900

STRICT: year +/-1; km +/-30% (floor +/-20,000); variant must match; power +/-10kW (both-known); transmission must match (both-known)
BROAD : year +/-3; km +/-60% (floor +/-40,000); any engine of model; power +/-30kW (both-known); transmission ignored

NOTE: prices assumed EUR on BOTH sides (inventory currency UNCONFIRMED).
Retrieval: keyword search, 2 page(s)/source, 1.2s delay. Sources never merged.

